<figure class="batching-diagram" aria-labelledby="batching-diagram-caption">
	<div class="diagram-scroll">
		<div
			class="diagram-canvas"
			role="img"
			aria-label="Schematic comparison: serial advances one request at a time, static batching shrinks without refill, and continuous batching mixes prefill and decode to refill active slots."
		>
			<div class="diagram-axis">
				<span>Model iterations</span>
				<span aria-hidden="true">time →</span>
			</div>

			<div class="lane">
				<div class="lane-title">
					<strong>Serial</strong>
					<span>batch = 1</span>
				</div>
				<div class="steps">
					<span class="step prefill">R1 P</span>
					<span class="step decode medium">R1 D ×3</span>
					<span class="step prefill">R2 P</span>
					<span class="step decode long">R2 D ×15</span>
					<span class="step neutral long">… one request at a time …</span>
					<span class="step decode">R16</span>
				</div>
				<div class="call-count">160 calls</div>
			</div>

			<div class="lane">
				<div class="lane-title">
					<strong>Static</strong>
					<span>closed batch</span>
				</div>
				<div class="static-track">
					<div class="steps">
						<span class="step prefill">8P</span>
						<span class="step decode medium">8D ×3</span>
						<span class="step decode medium faded-1">6D ×4</span>
						<span class="step decode medium faded-2">4D ×4</span>
						<span class="step decode medium faded-3">2D ×4</span>
						<span class="step prefill">next 8P</span>
					</div>
					<div class="waiting-rail">
						R9–R16 wait through the first closed batch; empty slots cannot refill
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="call-count">32 calls</div>
			</div>

			<div class="lane">
				<div class="lane-title">
					<strong>Continuous</strong>
					<span>refill each iteration</span>
				</div>
				<div class="steps">
					<span class="step prefill">1P</span>
					<span class="step mixed medium">1D + 7P</span>
					<span class="step mixed medium">5D + 3P</span>
					<span class="step mixed medium">7D + 1P</span>
					<span class="step decode long">8D ×9</span>
					<span class="step neutral long">tail: 7D → 5D → 2D → 1D</span>
				</div>
				<div class="call-count">29 calls</div>
			</div>

			<div class="legend" aria-label="Diagram legend">
				<span><i class="swatch prefill"></i>P = prefill requests</span>
				<span><i class="swatch decode"></i>D = decode requests</span>
				<span><i class="swatch mixed"></i>mixed prefill + decode</span>
				<span><i class="swatch waiting"></i>waiting work</span>
				<span>×N = repeated model calls</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<figcaption id="batching-diagram-caption">
		Schematic, not to scale. Static batching leaves completed slots empty until the
		closed batch retires; continuous batching refills them before the next iteration.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

